      "mergeID": "6639aaae789346694018a8a8",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The issue is that roleplaying groups with \"Uniform\"-avatars (like Police, Military, Clubs and so on) need to make their avatars public for the whole group to use them.\n\nThat comes with the problem that users that are not in the group can freely copy them.\n\nSo they use pricy commissioned avatars without permission for their own groups, try to damage the reputation of the original group or cause troubles, confusion and issues in general with them.\n\nA simple upload-flag in unity like \"upload for group [group.1234]\" in unity would already solve this.\n\nFor this to work the creator needs to own the group or at least have admin rights.\n\nIt would solve so many issues for these groups with group related avatars.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Group Avatars  (Avatars that can only be used if you're member of a group)",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6389e326a85b8545ec95989c",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe that would be amazing none the less be 100% great for us only hence why people tend to steal the models we currently have open for us and only us and put them into a avatar search engine if we had codes on them and made them unique to us that would be a bigger thing that makes the group more secure with our avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
