      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6639aacb07e47e87a3456b17",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The ability to make specific avatars you've uploaded be accessible only if you're in a Group - and then the ability to make certain avatars accessible only to specific roles in said Group - would be an incredible boon for avatar makers. I hope this is something that could be considered for the near future.",
