  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-02T11:36:06.499Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be beneficial for the groups system to have some kind of access control to specific avatars (and worlds). \n\nHaving group members have access to 'Group Avatars' (ideally from a group menu in game) for that group has potential for a few use cases:\n\n- Share avatars with friends / clientele / supporters within app\n\nGood for users who do not want to use custom avatars, but not necessarily technically inclined, etc. \n\nAlso would be good for something like a Patreon tier reward.\n\n- Roleplaying / themed groups\n\nAllow access to avatars for that groups theme for RP / events. \n\n- co-working / testing \n\nCan test avatars co-operatively etc in-game, rather than pass files around. Good for multiple creators working on the same thing, or creator working with a client to make something\n\n- Options for performance gated events\n\nEvents and clubs can provide appropriate avatars\n\nGenerally reduces friction for shared, semi-private content, and would make things more accessible in-app rather than externally!",
